    "description": "The water meters type GWU are ultrasonic water meters with an electronic indicating device, designed to measure, memorise and display the volume at metering conditions of water passing through the measurement transducer. They are also manufactured under the Model / Product names Salil / Intellisonic. The family covers the nominal diameters DN15 and DN20. The meters are fitted with an easily readable 9-digit LCD with measuring units and information field, and a 3.6 V Lithium thionyl chloride battery. An impulse output via optical port is optional. The meters may be installed to operate in any positions. The meter has a separation of software; the version and CRC of the legally relevant SW are displayed in the auto-rounding menu on the LCD."
